Josh 4:1 , Twelve men are appointed to take twelve stones for a memorial out of Jordan;
Josh 4:9 , Twelve other stones are set up in the midst of Jordan;
Josh 4:10 , The people pass over;
Josh 4:14 , God magnifies Joshua;
Josh 4:15 , The priests commanded to come out of Jordan;
Josh 4:20 , The twelve stones are pitched in Gilgal.
